cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it and the two upstream projects it builds on."
title: "super_super_apm: SUPER + Super-LIO mission on ArduPilot SITL"
abstract: >-
  Two laps of a 10 m-radius hexagon through a 522-pillar forest, planned by SUPER, tracked by Super-LIO as
  the only state source, flown by ArduPilot SITL and graded offline from the recordings by a fixed
  acceptance table.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-24"
